## 4. Review severity (`BLOCKER` / `MAJOR` / `MINOR`)

| Severity | Finding | Review Verdict Impact |
|---|---|---|
| `BLOCKER` | A check `FAIL`s after simplification; wrapper/alias/re-export left after a move; S12 violated; a decision ({{decision_notation}}) ignored | `CHANGES_REQUESTED` |
| `MAJOR` | Unnecessary complexity in the diff with a named catalog row | Fixed in the same revision when inside scope |
| `MINOR` | Small, local simplification opportunity | Optional |

A "simplification" that changed a result, status, transaction or error path is a **defect** with a failure scenario, not a simplification finding. Only code changed in the phase is graded.

